  "visibleTextSnippet": "This website utilizes technologies such as cookies to enable essential site functionality, as well as for analytics, personalization, and targeted advertising. To learn more, view the following link: Privacy Policy\nMANAGE PREFERENCES\nSkip to content\nGET SUPPORT\nLOGIN\nBOOK A DEMO\nVirtual Data Room\nOPEN VIRTUAL DATA ROOM\nFirmex For\nOPEN FIRMEX FOR\nIndustries\nOPEN INDUSTRIES\nResources\nOPEN RESOURCES\nPricing\nAbout Firmex\nOPEN ABOUT FIRMEX\nSimplified data rooms, proven results\n\nYour partner in deals, diligence, and document control.\n\n223,000+\n\nCOMPANIES TRUST FIRMEX\n\n1.4 million+\n\nUSERS SUPPORTED\n\n180+\n\nCOUNTRIES SERVED\n\n189,000\n\nPROJECTS COMPLETED\n\nBoost diligence with your virtual data room\nComplete access control\nComplete access control\nEasily add users and groups and customize their permissions with granular precision.\nEasy uploads\nEasy uploads\nSimply drag and drop up to 50 GB files or add them via Email In. Stay organized with automatic indexing.\nAdvanced security\nAdvanced security\nShare data with sophisticated controls like watermarks and lock documents, and restrict access to viewing, saving, and printing.\nDetailed reports & analytics\nDetailed reports & analytics\nInform your strategy with real-time, customizable insights on who is active and what they are viewing.\nRobust features\nRobust features\nWork efficiently with built-for-purpose features like Q&A, View As, and Redaction.\nInstant setup\nInstant setup\nQuickly upload entire folder structures or replicate previous projects immediately.\nDeals completed\nwith Firmex\nCorporate Advisor Rovensa Acquires Family-owned Biostimulants\nLisage International Acquired by NSM Insurance Group\nCisco Systems Inc. acquired Threatology, Inc.\nBell Canada acquired Ziply Fiber\nAccelerated Innovations acquired by VertexOne\nQuinbrook Infrastr"
